<title>JAPAN: JT sees 97/98 parent current profit at 107 bln yen.</title>
<headline>JT sees 97/98 parent current profit at 107 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Tobacco Inc (JT) said on Friday it expects to post a parent current profit of 107 billion yen on expected sales of 2.47 trillion yen in the year to March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>In November, JT said it expected its parent current profit in 1996/97 to be 119.00 billion yen on expected sales of 2.65 trillion yen.</p>
</text>
